# These are some examples of commonly ignored file patterns.
# You should customize this list as applicable to your project.
# Learn more about .gitignore:
#     https://www.atlassian.com/git/tutorials/saving-changes/gitignore

# Node artifact files
node_modules/
dist/

# Compiled Java class files
*.class

# Compiled Python bytecode
*.py[cod]

# Log files
*.log

# Package files
*.jar

# Maven
target/
dist/

# JetBrains IDE
.idea/

# Unit test reports
TEST*.xml

# Generated by MacOS
.DS_Store

# Generated by Windows
Thumbs.db

# Applications
*.app
*.exe
*.war

# Large media files
*.mp4
*.tiff
*.avi
*.flv
*.mov
*.wmv

# VS Code
.vscode
# logs
legged_gym/logs
logs
#runs

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# assets/ 素材与产出目录约定（详见 legged_gym/legged_gym/envs/go2/viz_config.py）
#   assets/paper/   原论文素材（配图与 PDF）      -> 入库
#   assets/figs/    论文出图（trajectory/metrics/summary） -> 入库
#   assets/data/    实验数据（compare/trajectories）      -> 入库
#   assets/archive/ 旧压缩包等归档                       -> 入库
#   assets/runs/    运行时产出（截图/相机帧），随时可重新生成 -> 不入库
# 注意：历史上已用 git mv 迁入 assets/runs/ 的素材仍被跟踪，
#       下面的规则只影响之后新生成的文件。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#assets/runs/

# other
*.egg-info
__pycache__# 忽略runs下所有内容
assets/runs/*
# 放行benchmark目录
!assets/runs/navigation_benchmark/
!assets/runs/navigation_benchmark/**
# 覆盖前面的runs忽略规则，放行这个benchmark目录
!assets/runs/navigation_benchmark/
!assets/runs/navigation_benchmark/**
# 忽略assets/runs下所有内容
assets/runs/*
# 例外放行benchmark目录
!assets/runs/navigation_benchmark/
!assets/runs/navigation_benchmark/**
